{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，X 对人物动机和情绪转折的因果解释比较省略，例如 S06 的孤单、S10 暂时放下对未来的担忧，Y 交代得更清楚。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X 的短句和【】高亮让人能在听音乐时迅速抓住人物此刻的念头，不必读完一大段才能知道重点；分时出现的感受也能跟音乐的变化同步，感官层次更丰富，具体到声音、身体和水面动态。Y 的优势是把人物为什么犹豫、为什么高兴、为什么又害怕解释得更完整，前后因果也更连贯，但较长的叙述容易让观众把注意力放在阅读上。综合边听边看的实际体验，我更倾向 X，虽然它需要加强人物心理变化之间的连接。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "c8703c03-c744-4d81-9d3e-0a5b86b59526", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261106T074203557889Z", "elapsed_seconds": 66.25, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T07:43:09.818906+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "133080afc92a9ba640afdce7503c26b4e3fcc7e1beac7b61b4d90ac1fb1cb644", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatg